{title:"Trump–Epstein associations and release controversy",type:"Reporting",date:"2026-01-30",summary:"Reuters reported their past friendship, document-release delays and redactions; a relationship or mention is not proof of involvement in Epstein's crimes.",url:"https://www.investing.com/news/general-news/trumps-justice-department-releases-new-cache-of-jeffrey-epstein-files-4476710"},
{title:"Recovered: The Trump–Epstein Contradiction",type:"Author research",date:"2025-09",summary:"Earlier authored chronology: 2002 'terrific guy' statement, disputed 2003 birthday note, later falling-out, and shifting public statements. Recovery summary only; original complete text not located.",url:""},
